@startuml
[*] --> CreateUserAccount : [Create User Account]
state Choice1 <<choice>>
state Choice2 <<choice>>
state Choice3 <<choice>>
state Choice4 <<choice>>
state Choice5 <<choice>>
state Choice6 <<choice>>
state Choice7 <<choice>>
state Choice8 <<choice>>
state Choice9 <<choice>>
state Choice10 <<choice>>
state Choice11 <<choice>>

CreateUserAccount : entry / Start state
CreateUserAccount : do / Fill in required details
CreateUserAccount : exit / Login

CreateUserAccount --> LoginUser : account created

LoginUser : entry / User registration
LoginUser : do / Authenticate user credentials
LoginUser : exit / Logged In Successfully

LoginUser --> ApplyForVisa : [Apply for Visa]
ApplyForVisa : entry / User logged in
ApplyForVisa : do / Make payment and submit application
ApplyForVisa : exit / Application accepted

ApplyForVisa --> ViewStatus : [View Status]

state "View Status" as ViewStatus
ViewStatus : entry / User applied for visa
ViewStatus : do / Display status
ViewStatus : exit / Check Status

ViewStatus --> CheckStatus : [Check Status]
CheckStatus : entry / User viewed status
CheckStatus : do / Check application status
CheckStatus : exit / Cancel Application or Modify Details

CheckStatus --> CancelApplication : [Cancel Application]

state "Cancel Application" as CancelApplication
CancelApplication : entry / User wants to cancel application
CancelApplication : do / Cancel application
CancelApplication : exit / Logout

CancelApplication --> Logout : [Logout]

CheckStatus --> ModifyDetails : [Modify Details]
ModifyDetails : entry / User logged in
ModifyDetails : do / Update user details
ModifyDetails : exit / View Details or Logout

ModifyDetails --> ViewDetails : [View Details]

state "View Details" as ViewDetails
ViewDetails : entry / User modified details
ViewDetails : do / Display updated details
ViewDetails : exit / Logout

ViewDetails --> Logout : [Logout]

CheckStatus --> GiveFeedback : [Give Feedback]
GiveFeedback : entry / User checked status
GiveFeedback : do / Provide feedback
GiveFeedback : exit / Logout

GiveFeedback --> Logout : [Logout]

ApplyForVisa --> PurposeOfApplication : [Purpose of Application]
PurposeOfApplication : entry / Document check
PurposeOfApplication : do / Update visa status
PurposeOfApplication : exit / Status updated

Choice1 --> PurposeOfApplication : approved
Choice2 --> PurposeOfApplication : rejected

PurposeOfApplication --> Logout : [Logout]

ModifyDetails --> Logout : [Logout]
ViewDetails --> Logout : [Logout]
GiveFeedback --> Logout : [Logout]
CancelApplication --> Logout : [Logout]

LoginUser --> Logout : [Logout]

@enduml
